# Embed

A video from YouTube or Vimeo, over `https`. The address is rewritten to the privacy-friendly
player and loaded in a sandboxed frame. Nothing else can be embedded, and the block has no body.
A site that uses no embed forbids all frames in its Content-Security-Policy.

````markdown
:::embed url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ"
:::
````

:::embed url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqz-KE-bpKQ"
:::
